  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the rice in a fine mesh strainer and cook according to package instructions.",
    "In a small bowl, whisk together soy sauce, rice vinegar, sugar, and salt.",
    "Add the pickled ginger, dried mint, and coconut cream to the bowl and stir until well combined.",
    "Transfer the cooked rice to a large bowl and stir in the soy sauce mixture.",
    "Add the water to the bowl and stir until the rice is well combined and has a sticky consistency.",
    "Using a small amount of water, shape the rice mixture into small triangular shapes.",
    "Serve the onigiri in a mason jar or on a plate."
